## 11. Validation summary

**Executed by candidate** (receipts: `witnesses.json`; isolated arithmetic/logic checks — they do not establish full-application behavior):

- **[W1] Coordinate precision policy** — float64 JSON round-trip exact; float32 lossy (≈3.8e-4 µm on the sampled vertex); mm→µm canonicalization exact for the sampled value. `exec-pcttegac`.
- **[W2] Bounded-access arithmetic** — 3.355 GB uint16 model: plane read = 8 MiB (0.25% of source); 1 GiB cache = 128 planes; honest refutation of the "3 copies exceed 16 GiB" capacity framing (they don't at this size). `exec-vfni4c27`.
- **[W3] Display mapping purity** — window/level changes rendered bytes, checksum of samples unchanged. `exec-kunl_it0`.
- **[W4] GeoJSON export semantics** — naive µm coordinates are invalid or silently misread as WGS84 degrees under RFC 7946; axis flip undetectable. `exec-b195f0gu`.

